      "execution": {
        "startingPosition": "Log the total bar plus plates. Stand with the bar in the front rack and both feet in a symmetric stance.",
        "movement": "Dip quickly, drive through the hips, knees, and ankles, then move under the rising bar as both feet briefly leave the floor.",
        "endpoint": "Receive symmetrically in a second dip with both elbows fully straight overhead.",
        "returnPhase": "Stand fully with the feet inline, then lower the bar under control to the front rack.",
        "controlledJoints": "Keep the dip and drive straight and receive with controlled hip, knee, and ankle flexion.",
        "supportAndPosture": "Brace the trunk and keep a secure two-hand grip without torso support.",
        "disqualifyingCompensations": ["Keeping both feet planted changes the lift into a push press.", "Receiving in a split stance changes the lift into a split jerk.", "Pressing to lockout after the receive is a press-out."]
